('527.mp4', 'Animals: anthropomorphic animal, furry creature, small furry animal. Objects: motorcycle, helmet, scarf, log, armor. Nature: forest, woodland. Actions: riding, sitting, jumping, climbing. Emotions: adventurous, confident, adventure, excitement, humorous. Scenes: outdoor, natural, forest, forest path. Concepts: adventure, whimsy, anthropomorphism', 'Animals: anthropomorphic animal, furry creature, small furry animal. Objects: motorcycle, helmet, sc...', 'anthropomorphic animal, furry creature, small furry animal, motorcycle, helmet, scarf, log, armor, forest, woodland, riding, sitting, jumping, climbing, adventurous, confident, adventure, excitement, humorous, outdoor, natural, forest, forest path, adventure, whimsy, anthropomorphism', 'A cute, anthropomorphic animal is dressed in a helmet and scarf, confidently sitting on a small motorcycle. The scene is set against a blurred, natural background, suggesting a forest or woodland setting.', 'A small, furry creature dressed in armor is captured mid-jump on a motorcycle over a log in a forest. The background is blurred, emphasizing the speed and motion of the creature.', 'A small, furry animal is riding a motorcycle up a steep dirt path. The animal is wearing a helmet and a leather vest, adding a humorous touch to the adventurous scene.', '720x1280', '9:16', 30.0, '10s'),
('528.mp4', 'Animals: wolf. People: crowd, humans. Objects: leather strap, cloth wrap, warrior attire. Actions: observing, standing, walking. Emotions: power, authority, awe, trepidation. Scenes: ancient setting, mythical environment, fantasy, ancient world. Concepts: fantasy, mythology, power, dominance. Nature: rocky landscape', 'Animals: wolf. People: crowd, humans. Objects: leather strap, cloth wrap, warrior attire. Actions: o...', 'wolf, crowd, humans, leather strap, cloth wrap, warrior attire, observing, standing, walking, power, authority, awe, trepidation, ancient setting, mythical environment, fantasy, ancient world, fantasy, mythology, power, dominance, rocky landscape', 'A towering anthropomorphic wolf with muscular build stands confidently amidst a crowd in a rugged, ancient setting. The creature is adorned with a leather strap and a cloth wrap, exuding a sense of power and authority. Onlookers appear captivated and perhaps wary, as they observe the imposing figure.', 'A towering, muscular anthropomorphic wolf strides confidently through a rocky landscape. The creature is dressed in a warrior-like attire, exuding power and dominance. In the background, several human figures observe the imposing figure with a mix of awe and trepidation.', NULL, '720x1280', '9:16', 30.0, '5s'),
('529.mp4', 'People: young woman, student. Objects: school uniform, hallway. Actions: walking, standing, posing. Emotions: confidence, serenity, calm, serene, relaxed. Scenes: school, hallway, school hallway. Concepts: education, youth, sunset lighting, sunset', 'People: young woman, student. Objects: school uniform, hallway. Actions: walking, standing, posing. ...', 'young woman, student, school uniform, hallway, walking, standing, posing, confidence, serenity, calm, serene, relaxed, school, hallway, school hallway, education, youth, sunset lighting, sunset', 'A young woman in a school uniform walks confidently down a sunlit hallway. Her long hair catches the warm glow of the setting sun, creating a serene and uplifting atmosphere.', 'A young woman in a school uniform stands in a sunlit hallway. Her long hair is illuminated by the warm light streaming through a window behind her.', 'A young woman in a school uniform walks down a sunlit hallway. The warm glow of the setting sun casts long shadows and highlights her relaxed expression.', '1216x1632', '38:51', 30.0, '10s'),
