('536.mp4', 'People: miniature figures, workers, miniature workers. Objects: tools, helmets, strawberry, buckets, giant strawberry. Actions: working, building, climbing, constructing. Emotions: industriousness, whimsy, whimsical, imaginative. Scenes: fantasy, miniature world, construction. Concepts: creativity, imagination, miniature world', 'People: miniature figures, workers, miniature workers. Objects: tools, helmets, strawberry, buckets,...', 'miniature figures, workers, miniature workers, tools, helmets, strawberry, buckets, giant strawberry, working, building, climbing, constructing, industriousness, whimsy, whimsical, imaginative, fantasy, miniature world, construction, creativity, imagination, miniature world', 'The image depicts a whimsical scene where miniature figures are engaged in various activities around a large, intricately detailed strawberry. The strawberry serves as a fantastical structure with windows and a domed roof, resembling a tiny house bustling with life.', 'A whimsical scene depicts miniature workers bustling around a giant strawberry, which has been transformed into a fantastical building. The workers, wearing helmets and overalls, are engaged in various activities around the strawberry, which is adorned with windows and doors, creating a lively and imaginative setting.', NULL, '720x1280', '9:16', 30.0, '5s'),
